  "extensibility": "Tuning lives in ~/.config/omnemo/config.toml (see configuration above): ranking weights, decay, limits, near-duplicate gate, and your own categories with their own importance and half-life. The memory skill is plain Markdown that tells agents when to save and recall. Its copy lives in ~/.local/share/omnemo/skill and is linked as `omnemo` into each harness skill dir; the next `omnemo setup` copies the shipped version over it, so keep your own changes in a separate skill. The code is MIT and small (about 1,700 lines of Python).",

